<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia to tender A$300 mln Oct 2000 TAB bond.</title>
<headline>Australia to tender A$300 mln Oct 2000 TAB bond.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury will offer A$300 million of October 2000 Treasury adjustable rate bonds (TABs) at a tender on Friday, the Reserve Bank of Australia said.</p>
<p>The Bank said bids would be received until 12.45 pm. (0245 GMT) on Friday and results would be announced at 2.00 p.m. (0400 GMT). Settlement date is April 15.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
